      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e can we modifying FFI bindgen behavior to change type of `FDT_ERR_*`?\n\nYeah, that\u0027s the first thing I looked into but `--default-macro-constant-type` sets the type for _all_ the macros in the bindgen, AFAICT. However, we\u0027d want some as `c_int` (here, as the errors are intended to be used as `-FDT_ERR_*`) and some as `c_uint` (e.g. `FDT_MAX_PHANDLE`) so didn\u0027t seem appropriate either.",
